### MOMPS example calls (VS Code REST Client / similar)
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = <paste bearer>

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "operator", "password": "demo"}

### Telemetry ingest (replace TOKEN)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/telemetry/ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "machine_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "position": {"x": 12.5, "y": 8.2, "z": 10.1},
  "speed_m_s": 6.2,
  "fuel_l": 420,
  "payload_t": 210,
  "wear_index": 0.04,
  "event_type": "periodic"
}

### Simulation state
GET {{base}}/api/v1/simulation/state
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manual tick
POST {{base}}/api/v1/simulation/tick
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ML train (synthetic)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/ml/train/synthetic
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Predict TTF
POST {{base}}/api/v1/ml/predict/ttf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hours": 320, "wear_mm": 15}
